zh:
对每个空间分量， $U^i=\frac{dx^i}{d\tau}
     =\frac{dx^i}{dt}\frac{dt}{d\tau}
     =v^i\frac{dt}{d\tau}.$ 将式 [eq:l6-proper-time]除以 $dt^2$： $\left(\frac{d\tau}{dt}\right)^2
